# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Grass Painter — environment
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in a token. The app never asks for one
# in the interface; it reads it from here.
# Get one at sketchfab.com -> Settings -> Password & API.
# Searching works with no token; only downloading a model needs one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# For running on your own machine, or a deploy only you can reach.
# Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the JavaScript it ships, so this
# token IS readable by anyone who opens a deployed page. Not a secret.
VITE_SKETCHFAB_TOKEN=

# For a public deploy: leave the line above blank and use these two instead.
# The token stays on the server inside api/sketchfab.js and never reaches the
# browser; the flag tells the client to route through that function.
SKETCHFAB_TOKEN=
VITE_SKETCHFAB_PROXY=
